@startuml StateDiagram
title PayLink - Payment State Diagram

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 50

[*] --> Initiated : payment created

Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass\nand wallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails\nor insufficient funds

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within timeout\n(10 s for live billers)

Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms\n(callback, retry or settlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses\nor reconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : hold released to wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
    Never refunded automatically.
    Re-queried 3 times (after 1, 5
    and 15 minutes), then waits
    for reconciliation.
end note

note bottom of Completed
    Final states:
    Completed, Rejected, Refunded
end note

@enduml